    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> to use to configure the message\nlistener responsible to serve an endpoint detected by this processor.",
      "translation": "设置用于配置由该处理器检测到的端点所负责的消息监听器的<a href=\"../MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The default <a href=\"../MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> implementation creating an\n<a href=\"../../../invocation/InvocableHandlerMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>InvocableHandlerMethod</code></a> with the necessary\n<a href=\"../../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> instances to detect and process\nmost of the use cases defined by\n<a href=\"../../MessageMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>MessageMapping</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认 `<a href=\"../MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>` 实现会创建一个 `<a href=\"../../../invocation/InvocableHandlerMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>InvocableHandlerMethod</code></a>`，并包含必要的 `<a href=\"../../../invocation/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>` 实例，以检测和处理由 `<a href=\"../../MessageMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>MessageMapping</code></a>` 定义的绝大多数用例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> to use to build the\n<a href=\"../../../invocation/InvocableHandlerMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>InvocableHandlerMethod</code></a> responsible to manage the invocation\nof this endpoint.",
      "translation": "设置 <a href=\"../MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> 用于构建负责管理此端点调用的 <a href=\"../../../invocation/InvocableHandlerMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation\"><code>InvocableHandlerMethod</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
